==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~14 seconds<sup>90f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~14 seconds<sup>90f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6~14 seconds<sup>180f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 6~14 seconds<sup>180f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Le'boin]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.

==Strategy==
By now, it is highly recommended to have the [[Energy Drink]], [[Relativity Clock]], [[Legendary Cat Shield]] and Legendary Cat Sword [[Treasure]]s (preferably all Superior), as well as level 10 [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] and Base Upgrades.

As always, start by upgrading your [[Worker Cat]] to max level. When the enemies come close to your base, send out a few [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]]. When Jackie Peng is approaching your base, send out [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cats]] and meatshields. When Gory spawns, deploy [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] and some [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cats]]. [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cats]] will help against Sir Seal, so remember them.

Things get serious when Le'boin spawns, so you will need to spam Mythical Titan Cats along with Sexy Legs Cats, [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] and meatshields. If you aren't fast enough, another Le'boin will spawn.

A variation of the previous strategy: When Jackie Peng arrives, send out a '''constant''' stream of meatshields and throw in Mythical Titan Cat (a continuous wave of Wall Cats would do, assuming you have saved up your money). While still sending out waves, send in long-ranged attackers like Sexy Legs Cat, [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and/or [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]] if you are in Chapter 3. They will hopefully annihilate the support before Le'boin joins the party.

