==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Fukushima Prefecture'''.
*The dish on Fukushima Prefecture's base is a bowl of [[wikipedia:Kitakata ramen|Kitakata ramen]], which originates from Kitakata, Fukushima and is one of Japan's three most popular ramen.

